  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The boho shawl grows from a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "boho-crescent"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "crescent"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " spine outward. You work a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "chain-space-mesh-boho"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "chain-space mesh"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " across each row, adding one repeat at each end every right-side row until the shawl reaches the required width. A row of dc along the lower edge anchors the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "knotted-fringe"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "knotted fringe"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use a plant-fibre or plant-blend sport yarn. Drape matters more than stitch definition here. Allow around 400 m."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "heading": "Materials",
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "Sport yarn",
              "qty": "400 m"
            },
            {
              "name": "4 mm crochet hook",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Tapestry needle",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Scissors",
              "qty": "1 pair"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Foundation"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chain 10. Work 1 dc in 4th ch from hook to set the first mesh square. Continue "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "chain-space-mesh-boho"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "chain-space mesh"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to end of foundation."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Body"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Row 1 (RS): Chain 5, turn. Work one extra mesh repeat at each end to increase the width. Repeat for the body rows until the piece spans 140 cm across the top edge."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Lower edge"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work 1 row of dc along the entire lower edge, placing 1 dc into each ch-1 space. This gives firm loops for the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "knotted-fringe"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "fringe"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fringe"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cut 35 cm lengths. Fold two together, push the folded loop through a dc, pull ends through and tighten the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "knotted-fringe"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "knot"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Repeat across the full lower edge. Trim to an even 15 cm."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What to try next"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The summer lace shawl uses the same mesh grid in cotton for warm-weather wear."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
